sequenceDiagram
    participant Orchestrator as FMS Guardrails<br/>Orchestrator
    participant Detector as Guardrails Regex Detector<br/>8080/TCP HTTP

    Note over Orchestrator,Detector: Flow 1: PII Detection Request

    Orchestrator->>Detector: POST /api/v1/text/contents<br/>HTTP 8080/TCP | No TLS | No Auth
    Note right of Detector: Request Body:<br/>{ "contents": ["text..."],<br/>  "detector_params": {<br/>    "regex": ["email", "ssn",<br/>      "credit_card", "<custom>"]<br/>  }<br/>}

    alt Built-in Pattern (email, ssn, credit_card)
        Note right of Detector: Lookup in built-in<br/>HashMap dispatch table<br/>Execute compiled regex
    else Custom Pattern
        Note right of Detector: Treat detector name<br/>as raw regex pattern<br/>Compile and execute
    end

    Detector-->>Orchestrator: JSON Response<br/>HTTP 200
    Note left of Orchestrator: Response Body:<br/>[{ "start": 0, "end": 15,<br/>   "text": "matched text",<br/>   "detection": "pii|custom",<br/>   "detection_type": "email",<br/>   "score": 1.0 }]

    Note over Orchestrator,Detector: Health Check

    Orchestrator->>Detector: GET /health<br/>HTTP 8080/TCP
    Detector-->>Orchestrator: 200 "healthy"
